{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_013","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"XChainAddAccountCreateAttestation","location_hint":"paragraph 201","char_start":4084,"char_end":4117,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_014","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 215","char_start":4338,"char_end":4368,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_015","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"An AccountDelete transaction deletes an account and any objects it owns in the XRP Ledger, if possible, sending the account&#x27;s remaining XRP to a specified destination account. See Deleting Accounts for the requirements to delete an account.","location_hint":"paragraph 227","char_start":4636,"char_end":4881,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_016","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"Requires the DeletableAccounts amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 228","char_start":4883,"char_end":4936,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_017","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"{\n\"TransactionType\" : \"AccountDelete\" ,\n\"Account\" : \"rWYkbWkCeg8dP6rXALnjgZSjjLyih5NXm\" ,\n\"Destination\" : \"rPT1Sjq2YGrBMTttX4GZHjKu9dyfzbpAYe\" ,\n\"DestinationTag\" : 13 ,\n\"Fee\" : \"200000\" ,\n\"Sequence\" : 2470665 ,\n\"Flags\" : 2147483648\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":4970,"char_end":5203,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_018","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"In addition to the common fields , AccountDelete transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":5254,"char_end":5341,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_019","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5345,"char_end":5396,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_020","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"CredentialIDs Array of Strings Vector256 No Set of Credentials to authorize a deposit made by this transaction. Each member of the array must be the ledger entry ID of a Credential entry in the ledger. For details, see Credential IDs .","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5400,"char_end":5635,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_021","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"Destination String - Address AccountID Yes The address of an account to receive any leftover XRP after deleting the sending account. Must be a funded account in the ledger, and must not be the sending account.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5637,"char_end":5846,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_022","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"DestinationTag Number UInt32 No Arbitrary destination tag that identifies a hosted recipient or other information for the recipient of the deleted account&#x27;s leftover XRP.","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5848,"char_end":6023,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_023","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"As an additional deterrent against ledger spam, the AccountDelete transaction requires a much higher than usual transaction cost : instead of the standard minimum of 0.00001 XRP, AccountDelete must destroy at least the owner reserve amount, currently 0.2 XRP . This discourages excessive creation of new accounts because the reserve requirement cannot be fully recouped by deleting the account.","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":6053,"char_end":6447,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_024","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"The transaction cost always applies when a transaction is included in a validated ledger, even if the transaction fails to delete the account. (See Error Cases .) To greatly reduce the chances of paying the high transaction cost if the account cannot be deleted, submit the transaction with fail_hard enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":6449,"char_end":6758,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_025","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, AccountDelete transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":6773,"char_end":6906,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_026","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"temDISABLED Occurs if the DeletableAccounts amendment is not enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6936,"char_end":7005,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_027","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"temDST_IS_SRC Occurs if the Destination matches the sender of the transaction ( Account field).","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":7007,"char_end":7102,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_028","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"tecDST_TAG_NEEDED Occurs if the Destination account requires a destination tag , but the DestinationTag field was not provided.","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":7104,"char_end":7231,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_029","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"tecNO_DST Occurs if the Destination account is not a funded account in the ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 247","char_start":7233,"char_end":7315,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_030","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"tecNO_PERMISSION Occurs if the Destination account requires deposit authorization and the sender is not preauthorized.","location_hint":"paragraph 248","char_start":7317,"char_end":7435,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_031","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"tecTOO_SOON Occurs if the sender&#x27;s Sequence number is too high. The transaction&#x27;s Sequence number plus 256 must be less than the current Ledger Index . This prevents replay of old transactions if this account is resurrected after it is deleted.","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":7437,"char_end":7691,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_032","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"tecHAS_OBLIGATIONS Occurs if the account to be deleted is connected to objects that cannot be deleted in the ledger. (This includes objects created by other accounts, such as escrows and for example NFT&#x27;s minted , even if owned by another account .)","location_hint":"paragraph 250","char_start":7693,"char_end":7947,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_033","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"tefTOO_BIG Occurs if the sending account is linked to more than 1000 objects in the ledger. The transaction could succeed on retry if some of those objects were deleted separately first.","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":7949,"char_end":8135,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_b357e7424a79_034","source_id":"src_b357e7424a79","source_hash":"0f16e6c1474458474d1c47f49c19208e317829c38a7b94c5aad06b74fa98582c","text":"Previous page Transaction Types","location_hint":"paragraph 258","char_start":8253,"char_end":8284,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:17.628Z"}
